quickly or too dramatically.

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:11.360
But the accuracy, the heart of the show,

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.620
especially with how long
the show has been around,

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:16.170
how many careers it's
made, George Clooney,

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.590
